          "prompt": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>Suppose the h(n) function is defined on the set of integer numbers as below.<br/>For the call h(3), how many calls to h will be made, including the original call?</p><pre><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">h</span><span class=\"hljs-params\">(<span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span> n)</span>\n  {<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (n == <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span> || n==<span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>)\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>);\n   <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">else</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span>(h(n-<span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>)+h(n-<span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span>));\n  }</code></pre></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Giả sử hàm h(n) được định nghĩa trên tập số nguyên như bên dưới.<br/>Với lượt gọi h(3), có bao nhiêu lượt gọi hàm h được thực hiện, kể cả lượt gọi gốc?</p><pre><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">h</span><span class=\"hljs-params\">(<span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span> n)</span>\n  {<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (n == <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span> || n==<span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>)\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>);\n   <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">else</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span>(h(n-<span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>)+h(n-<span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span>));\n  }</code></pre></div>",
